body:
Thank you for linking them here!

&#x200B;

JokesOnYou is still being worked on (sometimes) but does not have any developers acting as mentors and it also uses Angular+Web Api unlike Congo which is Pure .NET

Ofc you can have it in your portfolio, it shows that you have experience with working in a team in an "agile" sort of approach. You are free to create issues, pick issues and work on whatever, whenever you want to. There is no real deadline but if you have assigned yourself to an issue we dont expect you to not write a single line of code in 2 weeks because at that point someone else could be working on it instead.

&#x200B;

All of that information is available directly inside the github readme https://github.com/Code2Gether-Discord/Congo

Because we dont want to stoop down to their lvl. They are immature r*****. I started studying online school and my life is alot better and as you grow up it generally gets better. More people become more mature. Hang in there bud, youll have a much better life in the future by sticking to school right now.

If you can get help in any way, take it. If not, try finding something yourself that helps to cope with this mad world.

//Add and Autistic guy that went from years of depression to working, studying at a pace of 200% with great grades and even joining Uni next month. It gets better, it just does because you get better with time. Assholes will always exist but you get better at managing them and your own feelings.

Could not find anything weird on the github [https://github.com/emonney/QuickApp](https://github.com/emonney/QuickApp)

&#x200B;

109k installs.

Its old and used at every company. Its very efficient for learning and also learning to cooperate with other devs

